<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">State Duma</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The State Duma was the elected legislative assembly of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a>, created after the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russian-revolution-of-1905">Revolution of 1905</a>. Its powers were limited, and the tsar dissolved it several times. The Russian Empire profile treats it as a limited step towards constitutional government.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/state-duma.jpg" alt="State Duma" width="320" height="190" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Государственная Дума РФ · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gosduma_logo.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
